  Create a user booking/signup for a seminar event.
  This service attempts to create a user booking in any one of the states of BOOKED, REQUESTED, REQUESTED_ROLE, or WAITLISTED. See `mod_facetoface_booking_state_key` for full definitions of states.
  """
  mod_facetoface_event_create_user_booking(
    """
    Input for creating a seminar event booking/signup.
    """
    input: mod_facetoface_event_create_user_booking_input!
  ): mod_facetoface_event_create_user_booking_result!
}
